&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; rapi&#232;re de ma&#238;tre, +6 (1d6+1/18-20)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;A distance&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;arbal&#232;te l&#233;g&#232;re +1&lt;/i&gt;, +7 (1d8+1/19-20)
